1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,320
I'd like to welcome everyone to our special community event here on this Children's Day.

2
00:00:05,725 --> 00:00:14,525
As I look around, I cannot help but say how wonderful it is to see many children from our community holding the hands of their parents and grandparents.

3
00:00:15,525 --> 00:00:18,415
It provides me with great pleasure to see you all.

4
00:00:19,025 --> 00:00:31,165
Now, before we begin with the main attraction of the day, I'd like to remind all the parents that we will be holding classes every Thursday for those who wish to do a little extra for their children.

5
00:00:31,915 --> 00:00:40,745
As most of you the parents know and agree, it is vital that we instill in our children the special qualities each and every single one of them possesses.

6
00:00:41,925 --> 00:00:45,845
We as parents should help our children achieve their dreams and visions.

7
00:00:46,945 --> 00:00:53,670
And for this reason, we have set up special classes for the parents to learn how to bring out the best in their children.

8
00:00:54,145 --> 00:00:57,135
If any parents are interested, please talk to us today.

9
00:00:57,740 --> 00:01:03,865
Now, let's get back to today's agenda and bring out the person everyone here is waiting for.

10
00:01:04,705 --> 00:01:08,485
Would everyone give a big hand of applause for “Teddy the Clown”?
